flowchart TB
 R[Radio flux size catalog] --> S[Selection and scatter model]
 M[Counterparts and upper limits] --> Z[Redshift and IR likelihood]
 Z --> L[Cosmology and K correction]
 R --> L
 L --> C[Radio power class probabilities]
 S --> H[Population hierarchy]
 C --> H
 F[Sky region effects] --> H
 H --> B[Flux bin fractions and covariance]
 B --> V[Majority criterion and holdout]
